Third-party components
----------------------

Crates (Rust) — see each crate on crates.io for the full license text:

  • bootloader, bootloader_api — https://github.com/rust-osdev/bootloader
    SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT OR Apache-2.0

  • ovmf-prebuilt — https://github.com/rust-osdev/ovmf-prebuilt
    SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT OR Apache-2.0

Firmware (binary, when you run UEFI in QEMU)

  The ovmf-prebuilt crate downloads OVMF/EDK II firmware binaries. Those
  binaries are governed by the EDK II / TianoCore license (commonly
  BSD-2-Clause-Patent). Consult the archive or repository distributed with
  ovmf-prebuilt for the exact license and attribution requirements if you
  redistribute the firmware files.

Kernel bitmap font (kernel/src/font.rs, FONT_5X7)

  The glyph table is offered under the same MIT OR Apache-2.0 dual license as
  the rest of this repository. It follows common 5×7 monospace ASCII layouts
  used in embedded and hobby OS examples; if you need a font with an
  independent certification for your product, replace this table with a font
  whose license you have verified.

