VirtIO

  The VirtIO device programming model is defined by the VirtIO and VIRTIO PCI
  specifications (OASIS / project virtio). This repository does not ship the
  spec text; consult virtio-spec.org or your OS vendor for normative wording.

Raspberry Pi GPU boot files

  scripts/rpi-fetch-firmware.sh downloads start.elf, fixup.dat, bootcode.bin, and
  LICENCE.broadcom from the raspberrypi/firmware repository. Those files are
  subject to Broadcom / Raspberry Pi Ltd license terms in LICENCE.broadcom.
